        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>General explanation attachment</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>FRIENDS OF OFARRELL IS A NONPROFIT ORGANIZATION WHOSE MISSION IS TO ENCOURAGE AND SUPPORT, THROUGH VOLUNTEERISM AND FINANCIAL CONTRIBUTIONS, THE QUALITY ACADEMIC AND SOCIAL EDUCATION FOR THE OFARRELL CHARTER SCHOOL STUDENTS.ENROLLMENTELEMENTARY: 561MIDDLE SCHOOL: 630HIGH SCHOOL: 618INGENUITY: 141FOUNDATION SUPPORT INCLUDES THE GRADES K-12 THE OFARRELL CHARTER SCHOOL AND GRADES 6-12 INGENUITY CHARTER SCHOOL, AN INDEPENDENT STUDY PROGRAM WITH THREE RESOURCE CENTERS.THE OFARRELL CHARTER SCHOOL WEBSITE: WWW.OFARRELLSCHOOL.ORG EMAIL FOR THE FOUNDATION: FOUNDATION@OFARRELLSCHOOL.ORG</ExplanationTxt>
